Description: sound tray icon for the DragonBox Pyra
 A sound icon for MATE's Notification Area, meant to take the place of
 mate-volume-control-status-icon on the Pyra. Left click mutes and
 unmutes the sound; right click opens a small window to switch between
 the speakers and the headphones and to set the headphone volume.
 .
 It works with the Pyra's AESS kernels (5.6.19-m4*) only and needs no
 root: everything goes through PulseAudio as the logged-in user.
